  comment 1. Mathieu-Hill Parametric Resonance Scaffolding: Zero softmax attention matrix, token routing via EDO-22 acoustic lattice,;
  comment 2. Partial Weyl Closure Weight Confinement: Cl_S(I_W) = (A_n[f_s^-1] * I_W) cap A_n with finite Bernstein-Sato dimension,;
  comment 3. Indelible Engram Accumulator Memory: Long-term context stored as non-preferential energy E_acc >= 0 with zero context eviction,;
